    return page("Asimov C1-Nano Memory Performance", p.META + " Run 6 boot F1 (membench-jibin-011, 2026-11-06, commit 0c190a1, the L3 on) repeats run 3's command set: the bandwidth, multi-core, OCM-bandwidth and mesh-counter rows and the CPU 4 and 6 chains now have L3-on values. Generated by gen_perf_core.py through gen_perf.py.", toc, body)

